There is one possible wrinkle of defining colors as qualia. I don't think 
cameras can experience qualia; however, they are made by humans to detect 
the same/similar colors as humans do.

By the way I have decided that {lo ganseti} / {lo ga'ei broda} isn't a new 
type after all, but a specialized form of {li'i}. I have defined {li'imdu} 
so that {li'i} is its NU-form (c.f. {nundumu}, {du'umdu}, {su'umdu}). Thus 
my proposal is that {li'i} denotes subjective conscious experiences. Since 
{li'imdu} can convert both a {nu} and a {ka}, {li'i} may or may not have a 
{ce'u}.

